<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS8" title="In 5 Experiments ‣ FEVER: a large-scale dataset for Fact Extraction and VERification" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.8 </span>Manual Error Analysis</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS9" title="In 5 Experiments ‣ FEVER: a large-scale dataset for Fact Extraction and VERification" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.9 </span>Ablation of Training Data</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
